  "history": {
    "claims": [
      {
        "text": "At a cliff on Bai Gu mountain, Bai clan elder Bai Zhan Wen chooses this Gu so Fang Yuan and Bai Ning Bing cannot escape on a footless bird. He asks the clan to look after his grandson Bai Zhan Lie, then his flesh, skin, and bones turn into fire and his voice disappears with them.",
        "chapters": [
          227
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "intro",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "loc_bai_gu_mountain",
          "fac_bai_clan_bai_gu_mountain",
          "char_bai_zhan_wen",
          "char_fang_yuan",
          "char_bai_ning_bing",
          "char_bai_zhan_lie"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "The human torch flies after the footless bird. Fang Yuan’s maneuvering makes the torch pounce on empty air, then crash into mountain rocks when the bird reverses. Over six kilometre square of land burst into flames. In that sea of fire a lump of fire gathers into a human shape again and keeps chasing.",
        "chapters": [
          227
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "bai-gu-mountain-chase",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "When Bai Zhan Wen cannot catch them, he chooses to self-detonate. The explosion and flames engulf the footless bird. The bird is white bone, so the fire does little, but the impact cracks its body and it plummets before Fang Yuan steadies it. Fang Yuan himself is burning when the bird leaves the flame. He pours milk spring from tusita flower over his head to put the fire out.",
        "chapters": [
          227
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "bai-gu-mountain-chase",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "After flying for most of a day, the footless bird drops. It had made extreme diving and rising actions while suffering from the explosion of the human torch, and its body was filled with cracks and could no longer continue to fly.",
        "chapters": [
          228
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "footless-bird-cracks",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      }
    ]
  },
